        "text": "On [pi-durable hosts](durable.md#tools-the-model-sees) such as pi-action, `allowedTools` applies the same way to the tools Pit hides there, pi-durable's coding tools by default. Pit reads it when the host creates the extension; the project's file needs the host's `trustProject` and `cwd` options.",
