        "text": "Pit is a Pi extension, but its `typescript` tool also runs on hosts built on [`@earendil-works/pi-durable`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@earendil-works/pi-durable), such as [pi-action](https://github.com/cv/pi-action), which keeps one durable conversation per GitHub issue or pull request. The `pit/durable` entry point exports a pi-durable extension: the tool, its usage guidelines, and the user and project function catalogs as prompt sections.",
